title: Antonio Hernando
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/spain/portrait_hernando.jpg
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1
new-page: true
on-display: {!
if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.SpainGame) {
    window.SpainGame.renderVote(Q, 'sp-hernando-count', 'sanchez');
}
!}

= Antonio Hernando

Spokesperson of the parliamentary group and a central negotiator. Hernando lives by arithmetic: who votes yes, who abstains, who can be moved. Faction: Institutionalists. Loyal to the leadership, for now.

His current count for your investiture:

{!<div id="sp-hernando-count"></div>!}

- @cs_channel
- @group
- @pnv
- @root: Back

@cs_channel
title: Work the Ciudadanos channel
subtitle: Talks with Ciudadanos advance; Podemos notices.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: cs_talks += 1; rel_cs += 6; rel_up -= 3; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Hernando knows Ciudadanos's parliamentary team well. The talks move a step forward.

@group
title: Hold the parliamentary group together
subtitle: Lower dissent among Institutionalists and Modernisers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: institutionalists_dissent -= 6; modernisers_dissent -= 3; sanchez_authority += 3; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

A week of meetings with deputies, one by one. Nobody leaks for a while.

@pnv
title: Sound out the PNV
subtitle: Better relations with the Basque nationalists.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: rel_pnv += 10; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Aitor Esteban is courteous and noncommittal. That, from the PNV, is a good sign.

@candidacy
title: Seek investiture
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/spain/portrait_sanchez_2015.jpg
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_nominated = 1 and psoe_in_government = 0 and sanchez_leader = 1 and acting = 1
go-to: sp_investiture

@organisation
title: Secretary of Organisation
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1
new-page: true

= [? if year < 2017 : César Luena ?][? if year >= 2017 : José Luis Ábalos ?]

The Secretary of Organisation runs the party machine: the federations, the lists, the money. Faction: loyal to the leadership.

- @org_tour
- @org_money
- @org_discipline
- @root: Back

@org_tour
title: Tour the federations
subtitle: Calms the regional leaders and firms up the Federal Committee.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: regional_leaders_dissent -= 6; federal_committee_balance += 3; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

A month of dinners in regional capitals. The barons feel consulted.

@org_money
title: Squeeze the finances
subtitle: Raises party funds; members grumble.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: funds += 1.5; member_morale -= 2; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Dues are chased, contracts renegotiated, the headquarters' heating turned down.

@org_discipline
title: Discipline the critics
subtitle: More control of the Federal Committee; the old guard resents it.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: federal_committee_balance += 6; sanchez_authority += 2; institutionalists_dissent += 5; regional_leaders_dissent += 3; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

A few federations get new caretaker committees. The message is understood.

@lastra
title: Adriana Lastra
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1
new-page: true

= Adriana Lastra

Asturian, combative, and one of the few who stayed with you in the worst moments. She speaks to the members, and to Podemos. Faction: Progressives.

- @lastra_up
- @lastra_members
- @lastra_women
- @root: Back

@lastra_up
title: Open a channel to Podemos
subtitle: Better relations and talks with Podemos; Ciudadanos notices.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: rel_up += 8; up_talks += 1; rel_cs -= 2; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Coffee with Irene Montero's team. Nothing is promised; something is understood.

@lastra_members
title: Mobilise the members
subtitle: Raises morale and your personal following.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: member_morale += 5; sanchismo += 3; populism += 0.5; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

Assemblies in every federation. The members feel the party belongs to them again.

@lastra_women
title: Lead on equality
subtitle: A campaign aimed at women.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; Q.progressives_dissent -= 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'women', 1.5); } !}

Equal pay, the wage gap, gender violence: the PSOE's feminist agenda gets a month of attention.

@redondo
title: Iván Redondo
is-pinned-card: true
tags: sp_advisor
view-if: sanchez_leader = 1 and year >= 2017
new-page: true

= Iván Redondo

A political consultant who once worked for the PP and now works for you. He believes in data, narrative and nothing else. Faction: none but yours.

- @redondo_poll
- @redondo_narrative
- @redondo_centre
- @root: Back

@redondo_poll
title: Commission private polling
subtitle: See the PSOE's real support, without the published polls' error. · Costs 0.5 in party funds
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and funds >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?][? if advisor_action_timer = 0 : Needs 0.5 in party funds. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; Q.funds -= 0.5; Q.internal_psoe = Math.round(((Q.true_poll && Q.true_poll.psoe) || 0) * 10) / 10; Q.published_psoe = Math.round(((Q.poll && Q.poll.psoe) || 0) * 10) / 10; !}

Redondo's private poll puts the PSOE at [+ internal_psoe +]%. The published average says [+ published_psoe +]%.

@redondo_narrative
title: Build the narrative
subtitle: Strengthens your personal following; the party elders dislike it.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: sanchismo += 6; populism += 1; sanchez_authority += 2; institutionalists_dissent += 3; advisor_action_timer = 2; month_actions += 1; last_advisor_action = 1

The resistant, the survivor, the man the apparatus could not kill. The story writes itself, with some help.

@redondo_centre
title: Occupy the centre
subtitle: Move towards the centre and court Ciudadanos's voters.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] month(s) before the next adviser action. ?]
on-arrival: {! Q.advisor_action_timer = 2; Q.month_actions += 1; Q.last_advisor_action = 1; Q.rel_cs += 4; Q.progressives_dissent += 3; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.position(Q, -1, 0); window.SpainGame.target(Q, 'psoe', 'middle', 1.2); } !}

"The PSOE is the party of the great majority." Ciudadanos's voters hear it; so does Podemos.

@montero
